  <h3>Cleaning Your Cat's Water Fountain</h3>

  <p>
    Fresh, clean drinking water is essential for your cat's health.
    Clean the water fountain every three to six days, or more frequently
    if needed. Disassemble the fountain according to the manufacturer's
    instructions, wash the components, remove any buildup, and rinse
    thoroughly before refilling with fresh water. Clean or replace
    filters according to the manufacturer's recommendations.
  </p>

